{
  "project_id": 20,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 7288,
  "title": "What’s behind the rise of far right politics in Europe",
  "author": "Daphne Halikiopoulou",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/daphne_halikiopoulou_what_s_behind_the_rise_of_far_right_politics_in_europe",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T08:10:56.694439Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T08:10:56.694439Z",
  "lead_time": 61.097,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "So the far right is on the rise everywhere in Europe.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6D616E2335",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "Now, this is different from a while ago.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DC2964361B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 135,
        "text": "Just until recently, I used to use Spain or Portugal as examples of of countries that didn't have the far right as a significant force.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1E005C3530",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "And the problem is not just that these parties are getting a lot of votes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FC9D662713",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "The problem is that many of these parties are now in government.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8C3EBE24F1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "Look at Italy for example, look at Hungary, look at countries in Scandinavia.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C61DCBD0A3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "Or when they're not in government, they are actual contenders for it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FE33D505A8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 150,
        "text": "I don't want to think about the next French presidential election, or many other countries where these parties are significantly contending for power.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F79CC668E6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 17,
        "text": "Now, why is that?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "37E5A10C6B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "And why do other parties, more importantly, think that in order to defeat the far right, they need to copy the far right?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2878C0BB55",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "They need to become the far right?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E7F7597ED1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 152,
        "text": "Well, that is because we hear a story, wherever we look at why this is happening, the story we hear is that, well, you know, it's all about immigration.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "508892CAFB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "It's all about culture.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "79345B6E68",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 148,
        "text": "It's all about people now not wanting globalization, not wanting immigrants, not wanting transnationalism, people just wanting nationalist politics.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7E811C5D6F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 160,
        "text": "And all the parties are doing is that they are responding to this kind of popular demand, as we call it in academia, and therefore the far right is on the rise.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C13B8336C1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 25,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "debunk this myth and sort of disagree with this and say",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "78BD2D70BC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 161,
        "text": "And what I want to do is debunk this myth and sort of disagree with this and say, this is not a simple story at all, and it's not a story only about immigration.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "885D5022D6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "And it's not a story only about culture.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "954D26FB49",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 59,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "demand side",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "03BB0BFF33",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 197,
        "text": "Actually, what it is, is on, what we call in academia, the demand side or the people or the insecurities that drive people to vote for particular parties are multiple and extend way beyond culture.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CF509A2B1D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "They extend way beyond immigration.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BB3CA2F8FF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 80,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "very clever nationalist narratives",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B792173484",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 189,
        "text": "But on the supply, or in other words, the parties themselves, they are adopting very clever nationalist narratives that are really able to capture this very, very broad coalition of voters.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EBB75F152C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "So, let me start by actually showing some of this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9223BD70F5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "This is just some data.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7DE782ACA4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "I'm an academic, as I said, and so I love to talk with data and with evidence.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0B8106E550",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 168,
        "text": "And this is just a very, very simple graph that shows what the voters of far-right parties across different European countries look like, or what their preferences are.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2A4861E5B1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "And the one key thing that I take away from that is that there is a non-immigration route to far-right voting.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4949718388",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 101,
        "text": "This shows you that one third of far-right voters in Europe don't report immigration concerns at all.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "89045358C5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "It also shows you that in many countries where voters do have immigration concerns, these are economic.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F0F67F5856",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 192,
        "text": "In other words, these people have become susceptible to narratives that say that immigrants take away jobs, they take away access to the labor market, they take away access to social services.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C4E781E552",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 320,
        "text": "So what I am arguing is that while focusing on immigration is one, perhaps, one driver of far-right party support, for these parties to gain the percentages that we are seeing now, the 20 percent and the 30 percent and the 40 percent, we need to look way beyond immigration to see the other insecurities that drive them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1EC498219A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "And this is my visualization of the successful far right versus a non-successful far right.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C421E21D22",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 89,
        "endOffset": 101,
        "text": "culturalists",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CADCB09448",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 25,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "you here",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "51231B3E5E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "But actually they are a very small part of the electorate.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5BA9E69493",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 95,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "materialists",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9D1C6B823E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 231,
        "endOffset": 241,
        "text": "welfarists",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "28AE49BBC1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "I've done a lot of research on how social policies actually limit the propensity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CABF3F9179",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "They moderate, they compensate insecure people, thus limiting their propensity to vote for the far right.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D795E128A1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "They are the distrustful.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F376A71E19",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 171,
        "endOffset": 198,
        "text": "social contract obligations",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4300D42329",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 199,
        "text": "We have so much data about people losing trust in institutions and political and social institutions, in the parliament, in the government, in the state to deliver on its social contract obligations.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0716770B64",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "And the anti-greens.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "93DF1C73BC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "There is a new, big cleavage emerging across Europe.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A0707BA63A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 175,
        "text": "Those people who don't want to pay more for the environment, who are actually voting for the far right because they believe that they are being hurt by environmental policies.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "63C0A4644D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 208,
        "text": "These people are living particularly in rural areas of Europe, where they can't afford to say, give up their car and, I don't know, buy a new one that has no emissions or buy more environmentally-friendly ...",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "89575979DE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "Environmentally-friendly cars or vehicles, etc.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "339DB73537",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 32,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "peripheral voters",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FEC63B43D9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 138,
        "text": "It is capturing these voters that allows far-right parties to extend well beyond their secure voting base and get people to vote for them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C9899F900D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "How do they do that?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6A3A1F8515",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 45,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "you know, do you know any society",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F8D83F300E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 113,
        "text": "This is the key of what I'm arguing because, you know, do you know any society that doesn't have insecure people?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D6657AFED9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "There is no society that has no insecure people.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3D34C86E53",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 129,
        "text": "There is always going to be people who are worried about their economic situation, they're worried about their status in society.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D16DC8688C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "But these may or may not be captured by voters, depending on what the parties do.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FCFB82F4BE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "So parties have power to shape their own electoral fortunes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5979C758B5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "How are the far-right parties in Europe doing this?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8D0A1E80C4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "Well, they are putting forward what I call civic nationalist narratives.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FD227278E3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 36,
        "endOffset": 85,
        "text": "shifting the boundaries of toleration on its head",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E35ACB1A3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "Or in other words, they are sort of shifting the boundaries of toleration on its head.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "92E4B94EF0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "These parties are no longer saying \"I'm extreme, and I don't want people who are biologically different to me.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "89137E8DFC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 8,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "you know who's going to vote for a party that is openly racist?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E8A4462A5F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "No, what they say is, \"We exclude those who do not espouse our liberal democratic values.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7154D1098F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "We exclude those who don't espouse our liberal democracies.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DA6AD207BA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 85,
        "text": "They are antithetical to the very essence of the democracies that Europe is based on.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E19DBC8117",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "I've got some really interesting campaigns.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "939F00890B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "The AfD campaign, the AfD was recently called an extreme party in Germany.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "266E15C0CC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "Yet it's saying, \"No, we're not extreme.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4C8EBF26BC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "It had this bikini campaign a few years ago when it was competing for elections saying, \"Well, you know what?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "711BF99740",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 56,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "intolerant ideas",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5072C18A4C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "We can't, you know, drink our wine and we can't eat our pork because we are liberal democratic party and we just don't want to include those who ideologically exclude us.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1242671D71",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 171,
        "text": "Now, this is a very, very clever strategy because this makes parties appear more moderate.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A42B99466A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "It takes away the stigma of fascism.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F0C3B9133C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "It takes away the stigma of extremism.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "995CD5C7E6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "So a voter will say, well, \"It's OK, I can vote for these people because they are not actually extreme.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0B4847A394",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "But unfortunately, these parties are extreme.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2161126074",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "And we see that these parties are extreme as they increasingly enter government and they increasingly attack liberal democratic institutions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EDC4C2D824",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 141,
        "text": "So what am I saying here, just to finish?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EBDA695D21",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "I'm saying that if it was simply a story about society changing, society no longer being divided simply by haves and have nots, but divided on a transnational cleavage, then we could tackle immigration and that would be it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D7BD726186",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 223,
        "text": "But this is not what is going on.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F1D17BCB2D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "This is not at all.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DA595D59F4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "Other parties copying the far right on immigration are only making this problem worse.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BEABDF1B24",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 149,
        "text": "root of the problem",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "95246FDEF0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 149,
        "text": "They are only normalizing the far right and making the far right bigger, because the problem is not a problem necessarily that comes from the demand.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B9AE31B762",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "It's a problem of supply.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0DFF4C356F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "But what I'm saying is actually a good thing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D24DF8EAE2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 96,
        "text": "It's a positive thing because it means, if I am right, then this means that parties have agency.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CD3ADDEC26",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "79",
        "end": "79",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "And if the far right has the agency to capture broader and broader coalitions, that's a bad thing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0FDB1A2854",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "80",
        "end": "80",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "But it means that we also have agency to put on our own narratives.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "235C84E1CF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "81",
        "end": "81",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 101,
        "text": "Parties that oppose the far right can also put forward successful narratives to tackle the far right.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F48CB90542",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "82",
        "end": "82",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "We have agency, and that agency cannot be to copy the far right.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D20FF3FBBC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "83",
        "end": "83",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 161,
        "text": "That agency has to be to contradict the far right, to expose it for what it is, extreme, and to also put forward and promote the positive aspects of immigration.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D843125E7F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "84",
        "end": "84",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "775E066C89",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}